---
// CompatibilityMatrix: Host OS and Execution Engine support table
---

<section class="features-section" id="engines">
  <div class="section-tag">
    <span class="tag-accent">//</span>
    <span>COMPATIBILITY_MATRIX</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading-group">
    <h2>Execution Engine Matrix</h2>
    <p>
      RunZero adapts to your operating system, supporting containers and full
      virtual machines across macOS, Windows, and Linux.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="table-wrapper">
    <table class="comparison-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Engine Driver</th>
          <th>Host OS</th>
          <th>Execution Mode</th>
          <th>Key Strengths</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td
            ><strong
              >🪐 <a href="https://orbstack.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                >OrbStack</a
              > (Recommended)</strong
            ></td
          >
          <td>macOS (Apple Silicon &amp; Intel)</td>
          <td><span class="tag-crimson">Containers &amp; Linux VMs</span></td>
          <td
            >Instant boot, golden VM cloning, Rosetta 2 x86_64 acceleration,
            full systemd.</td
          >
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td
            ><strong
              >🐳 <a
                href="https://www.docker.com/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Docker Desktop</a
              ></strong
            ></td
          >
          <td>macOS, Windows, Linux</td>
          <td><span class="tag-crimson">Containers</span></td>
          <td>Universal cross-platform container support.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td
            ><strong
              >🪟 <a
                href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Windows WSL2</a
              ></strong
            ></td
          >
          <td>Windows 10/11 &amp; Server</td>
          <td><span class="tag-crimson">Native Linux VMs</span></td>
          <td
            >Native Linux execution without requiring Docker Desktop on Windows.</td
          >
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td
            ><strong
              >🚀 <a
                href="https://multipass.run/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Canonical Multipass</a
              ></strong
            ></td
          >
          <td>macOS, Windows, Linux</td>
          <td><span class="tag-crimson">Virtual Machines</span></td>
          <td
            >Universal cross-platform Ubuntu VMs via QEMU / Hyper-V /
            VirtualBox.</td
          >
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td
            ><strong
              >🐧 <a
                href="https://docs.docker.com/engine/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Native Linux Docker</a
              ></strong
            ></td
          >
          <td>Ubuntu, Debian, Arch, Homelabs</td>
          <td><span class="tag-crimson">Native Containers</span></td>
          <td>Zero VM layer, direct kernel speed for homelab servers.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-section {
    padding: 72px 0;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--crimson-light);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .tag-accent {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .section-heading-group {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .section-heading-group h2 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-heading-group p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .tag-crimson {
    color: var(--crimson-light);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .table-wrapper {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow-x: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }
  table.comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 600px;
  }
  table.comparison-table th,
  table.comparison-table td {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  table.comparison-table th {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  table.comparison-table a {
    color: var(--crimson-light);
  }
</style>
